<p>AYE HASSAN E MUJTABA..</p>

<p>Fatima ka raj dulara Hassan,<br>
Haidare Karrar ka pyara Hassan,<br>
Ahmade Zeesha'n ka dulara Hassan,<br>
Zehre dagha se tujhe mara Hassan.</p>

<p>Haye hua kya sitam-Aye Hasane Mujtaba<br>
Jaane Rasule umam-Aye Hasane Mujtaba<br>
Kushtaye ranjo alam-Aye Hasane Mujtaba<br>
Dediya hazrat ko sam-Aye Hasane Mujtaba</p>

<p>Zeher ne sadme ye jigar ko diye,<br>
Aayi jo qeh tukde lagan me gire,<br>
Haye sitam jahda berehem ne,<br>
Deke dagha apko mara Hassan.</p>

<p>Roti hai Qasim ki maa-Aye Hasane Mujtaba<br>
Karti hai Zainab fugha'n-Aye Hasane Mujtaba<br>
Chorda hame bhai jaan-Aye Hasane Mujtaba<br>
Chal base suye jinaa'n-Aye Hasane Mujtaba</p>

<p>Aye jigaro jaane Risalath panaah,<br>
Sarware dee'n charqhe Shahadat ke maah,<br>
Haidar o Zehra ki Shahadat ke maah,<br>
Kam nahi marna bhi tumhara Hassan.</p>

<p>Aata nahi dil ko chain-Aye Hasane Mujtaba<br>
Peet te hai sar Hussain-Aye Hasane Mujtaba<br>
Karti hai sab bewa ain-Aye Hasane Mujtaba<br>
Bachhou me hai shor o shain-Aye Hasane Mujtaba</p>

<p>Madare Qasim hai tapaa'n har ghadi,<br>
Bazuo me roti hai behne khadi,<br>
Beech me maiyyat hai tumhari padi,<br>
Hai yeh qayamat ka nazaara Hassan.</p>

<p>Hogaya mehshar ayaa'n-Aye Hasane Mujtaba<br>
Aap ne chorda jahaa'n-Aye Hasane Mujtaba<br>
Gham ka hai har su samaa'n-Aye Hasane Mujtaba<br>
Rote hai peero jawaa'n-Aye Hasane Mujtaba</p>

<p>Peet ke 'Masroor' yeh keh muttasil,<br>
Apka marna hai ghame jaa'n gusil,<br>
Tukde hai hazrat ke ghulamou ka dil,<br>
Humko nahi zabt ka yaara Hassan...</p>